PROJECT_ROOT = $PROJECT_ROOT   (the folder holding SkinCancer/)
SPLIT_ROOT   = $PROJECT_ROOT/splits_paper_seed42
DATA_ROOT    = $HAM_DATA_ROOT
OUTPUT_ROOT  = $PROJECT_ROOT/outputs
HAM_GPU      = 1
folds        = [3, 4]
  ok       $PROJECT_ROOT/splits_paper_seed42/global_train.csv
  ok       $PROJECT_ROOT/splits_paper_seed42/global_val.csv
  ok       $HAM_DATA_ROOT/HAM10000_metadata.csv
  ok       $PROJECT_ROOT/outputs
  ok       $PROJECT_ROOT/outputs/residual/cv_folds.csv
  nothing will be written under: $PROJECT_ROOT, $PROJECT_ROOT/outputs, $PROJECT_ROOT/splits_paper_seed42, $HAM_DATA_ROOT, $HAM_MASK_DIR
  temporary files elsewhere are left to the libraries

device = cuda

[Debug][DataPath]
  DATA_ROOT=$HAM_DATA_ROOT
  METADATA_CSV=$HAM_DATA_ROOT/HAM10000_metadata.csv
  SPLIT_ROOT=$PROJECT_ROOT/splits_paper_seed42
  image_dir=$HAM_DATA_ROOT/HAM10000_images_part_1
  image_count[$HAM_DATA_ROOT/HAM10000_images_part_1]=5000
  image_dir=$HAM_DATA_ROOT/HAM10000_images_part_2
  image_count[$HAM_DATA_ROOT/HAM10000_images_part_2]=5015
[Data] Found 10015 images across 2 directories.

S4  lesion-restricted training, the stored checkpoints re-evaluated
TALLY s4 lcrop fold=3 n=1598 wrong_mixed=369 wrong_single=367 flips=2
TALLY s4 lcrop fold=4 n=1598 wrong_mixed=263 wrong_single=264 flips=1
TALLY s4 bgdim fold=3 n=1598 wrong_mixed=294 wrong_single=294 flips=0
TALLY s4 bgdim fold=4 n=1598 wrong_mixed=255 wrong_single=255 flips=0

Per-fold counts are on the TALLY lines above. Add the two GPUs' logs with
  python fp32_probe.py --combine <log> <log>
